<topic template="Default" modified="2026-11-17T13:30:54.128+01:00" lasteditedby="robert" version="2" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="../helpproject.xsd">
  <title>SET BELL 命令</title>
  <keywords>
    <keyword>Commands</keyword>
    <keyword>SET commands</keyword>
    <keyword>SET BELL command</keyword>
  </keywords>
  <body>
    <header>
      <para styleclass="Heading1">SET BELL 命令</para>
    </header>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__FoxProOnly" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__CommandInclude" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">用途</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">启用或禁用当用户填满全屏输入中的字段或输入无效数据时发出的提示音。</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">语法</para>
    <para styleclass="Code with box">SET BELL ON | OFF | &amp;&lt;cMacro&gt;<br/>SET BELL TO [&lt;Options&gt;]</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">参数</para>
    <para styleclass="List">ON | OFF<tab/>启用或禁用提示音。该值也可以是一个宏（&amp;），其求值结果为 ON 或 OFF。</para>
    <para styleclass="List">TO [&lt;Options&gt;]<tab/>在 Visual FoxPro 中，这用于设置提示音的频率和持续时间。该命令会被接受但被忽略。</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">备注</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">该设置也可以通过函数 <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="html\Overload_XSharp_Core_Functions_SetBeep.htm" domain="XSharpRef.chm">SetBeep()</link> 使用。</para>
    <para styleclass="Body Text"><snippet src="__IncludeLibVFP" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">参见</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_SET_CONFIRM">SET CONFIRM</link>, <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="html\Overload_XSharp_Core_Functions_SetBeep.htm" domain="XSharpRef.chm">SetBeep()</link></para>
  </body>
</topic>
